1. New server provisioning

When a new server is created:

Example:

A company launches 20 AWS EC2 instances for a new application.

The Jenkins job installs:

nginx
docker
java-17
python3
git

automatically.

2. Security updates

Security team says:

"Install the latest OpenSSL package on all production servers."

Instead of manually updating hundreds of servers, Jenkins runs:

sudo dnf update openssl -y
